# macOS conflict copies. A synced folder resolves a clash by hanging a number
# off the end of the name ("08-alma-05-notes 2.json"), and 82 of those were
# committed and served in place of the real notes. They are never wanted.
*[ ][0-9].json
*[ ][0-9].js
*[ ][0-9].css

